<Legal title="Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information" heading="Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information" description="California (CCPA/CPRA) notice: Swarmnest does not sell or share personal information." path="/do-not-sell/">
<p><strong>Swarmnest does not sell your personal information and does not share it for cross-context behavioral advertising.</strong> We have not done so in the past 12 months. We do not run advertising trackers or sell email lists, and sponsors do not receive information about our visitors or subscribers.</p>
<p>Because we do not sell or share, there is nothing you need to opt out of. You can still send us an opt-out request, and we will record it so it applies if our practices ever change:</p>
<ul>
<li>Email <a href="mailto:hello@swarmnest.ai?subject=Do%20not%20sell%20or%20share">hello@swarmnest.ai</a> with the subject "Do not sell or share". No account or proof of identity is needed for an opt-out request.</li>
<li>Or turn on <a href="https://globalprivacycontrol.org/" rel="noopener">Global Privacy Control</a> in your browser. We treat a GPC signal as a valid opt-out request.</li>
</ul>
<p>An authorized agent may also make a request for you. We will not discriminate against you for making a request.</p>
<h2>Sensitive personal information</h2>
<p>We do not use or disclose sensitive personal information for any purpose that would give you a right to limit its use under California law.</p>
<h2>If this changes</h2>
<p>If we ever decide to sell or share personal information, we will update this page and our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> first, and we will honor opt-outs already received. For your other California rights (to know, delete and correct), see section 6 of the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
</Legal>
